msgid "1. You start with «%s», 5 peasants and room for 5 people only."
msgstr "1. You start with «%s», 5 peasants and room for 5 people only."

msgid "2. Send peasants to the forest, then build «%s»: +5 population."
msgstr "2. Send peasants to the forest, then build «%s»: +5 population."

msgid "3. Build «%s» by the forest and put a peasant on it."
msgstr "3. Build «%s» by the forest and put a peasant on it."

msgid "4. Click «%s» and train more peasants (50 food each)."
msgstr "4. Click «%s» and train more peasants (50 food each)."

msgid "5. Build «%s», «%s» or «%s» and train an army."
msgstr "5. Build «%s», «%s» or «%s» and train an army."

msgid "A Samogitian's hand does not shake, Lord Jakub. The heart shakes, and in battle it is not needed."
msgstr "A Samogitian's hand does not shake, Lord Jakub. The heart shakes, and in battle it is not needed."

msgid "A barrier of felled trees laid in the forest. Nobody passes it; fire burns it away."
msgstr "A barrier of felled trees laid in the forest. Nobody passes it; fire burns it away."

msgid "A brother priest: consecrates the land and casts the Order's spells."
msgstr "A brother priest: consecrates the land and casts the Order's spells."

msgid "A castle, the stronghold of the land: trains the best troops and houses many people. Like a town centre, it keeps your side in the game."
msgstr "A castle, the stronghold of the land: trains the best troops and houses many people. Like a town centre, it keeps your side in the game."

msgid "A chapel by the road. The prince gets down from his horse and goes inside for a moment. A lamp burns before the icon."
msgstr "A chapel by the road. The prince gets down from his horse and goes inside for a moment. A lamp burns before the icon."

msgid "A chapel of the Order. It gathers Power for spells and consecrates the land: shrines of other sides near it give half the Power."
msgstr "A chapel of the Order. It gathers Power for spells and consecrates the land: shrines of other sides near it give half the Power."

msgid "A church: trains priests and researches the faith's improvements."
msgstr "A church: trains priests and researches the faith's improvements."

msgid "A crash. A span of the bridge fell into the water, and the men on it with it."
msgstr "A crash. A span of the bridge fell into the water, and the men on it with it."

msgid "A crossbowman: slow to load, hits hard."
msgstr "A crossbowman: slow to load, hits hard."

msgid "A fast light horseman with javelins."
msgstr "A fast light horseman with javelins."

msgid "A field. A peasant working it brings in food; when it is worked out, it is sown again for its price."
msgstr "A field. A peasant working it brings in food; when it is worked out, it is sown again for its price."

msgid "A gate in your wall: your own people pass, enemies have to break it down. One or two archers on it shoot at enemies nearby."
msgstr "A gate in your wall: your own people pass, enemies have to break it down. One or two archers on it shoot at enemies nearby."

msgid "A half-brother in a grey cloak: the Order's medium horse."
msgstr "A half-brother in a grey cloak: the Order's medium horse."

msgid "A heavy Lithuanian lancer."
msgstr "A heavy Lithuanian lancer."

msgid "A hidden place of power gives one charge of Power. Stand the prince on it and cast «Wolf Trail»: a trail opens from it through the old forest or the bog for a minute, and on it the dogs find no scent."
msgstr "A hidden place of power gives one charge of Power. Stand the prince on it and cast «Wolf Trail»: a trail opens from it through the old forest or the bog for a minute, and on it the dogs find no scent."

msgid "A hive hollowed out in a forest tree. Two peasants take honey from it: food that never runs out."
msgstr "A hive hollowed out in a forest tree. Two peasants take honey from it: food that never runs out."

msgid "A house feeds more mouths. Train peasants at the yard and build a granary near the food."
msgstr "A house feeds more mouths. Train peasants at the yard and build a granary near the food."

msgid "A knight brother in a white cloak: the Order's heavy horse."
msgstr "A knight brother in a white cloak: the Order's heavy horse."

msgid "A light horseman from the Prussian lands."
msgstr "A light horseman from the Prussian lands."

msgid "A new age opens new buildings, troops and improvements."
msgstr "A new age opens new buildings, troops and improvements."

msgid "A shrine stands on it"
msgstr "A shrine stands on it"

msgid "A silver mine (grey blocks on a hill) gives silver."
msgstr "A silver mine (grey blocks on a hill) gives silver."

msgid "A smithy: researches better weapons and armor for your troops."
msgstr "A smithy: researches better weapons and armor for your troops."

msgid "A sortie from Dubysa! Beat it back and take the post again: while a post is lost, the blockade does not work."
msgstr "A sortie from Dubysa! Beat it back and take the post again: while a post is lost, the blockade does not work."

msgid "A store at the forest edge: woodcutters carry wood a shorter way. Researches forestry improvements."
msgstr "A store at the forest edge: woodcutters carry wood a shorter way. Researches forestry improvements."

msgid "A store by bog ore or a silver mine: miners carry a shorter way. Researches mining improvements."
msgstr "A store by bog ore or a silver mine: miners carry a shorter way. Researches mining improvements."

msgid "A store for food near the fields: peasants carry the harvest a shorter way. Researches farming improvements."
msgstr "A store for food near the fields: peasants carry the harvest a shorter way. Researches farming improvements."

msgid "A sturdy archer of the castle garrisons."
msgstr "A sturdy archer of the castle garrisons."

msgid "A tower with three or four archers shooting at enemies in range. Palisades and walls join onto it."
msgstr "A tower with three or four archers shooting at enemies in range. Palisades and walls join onto it."

msgid "A trading house. Trade is not in this version yet."
msgstr "A trading house. Trade is not in this version yet."

msgid "A wagon of the baggage train."
msgstr "A wagon of the baggage train."

msgid "A wall of sharpened stakes: drag to lay a line. Holds enemies off until they break through; it burns."
msgstr "A wall of sharpened stakes: drag to lay a line. Holds enemies off until they break through; it burns."

msgid "A watchtower of the border watch: it sees all round, by day further still."
msgstr "A watchtower of the border watch: it sees all round, by day further still."

msgid "A wise woman: heals those around her and casts the Duchy's spells."
msgstr "A wise woman: heals those around her and casts the Duchy's spells."

msgid "A wooden church. In the campaign the peasants who work near it are baptized; its priests and improvements are not in the game yet."
msgstr "A wooden church. In the campaign the peasants who work near it are baptized; its priests and improvements are not in the game yet."

