msgstr "Abilities"

msgid "About the game"
msgstr "About the game"

msgid "Advance to the next age"
msgstr "Advance to the next age"

msgid "Advance to: %s"
msgstr "Advance to: %s"

msgid "After the death of Vytautas the Grand Duchy split in two. Sigismund Kęstutaitis holds Vilnius, Trakai and Samogitia; Polotsk, Vitebsk and Smolensk went over to Švitrigaila, and the Livonian knights ride with him. Now Švitrigaila marches on Vilnius, and Sigismund has sent his son Michael against him, with the Poles of Jakub of Kobylany. Mikołaj Gintovt leads his banner in Michael's army. His brother Jurij rides with Švitrigaila."
msgstr "After the death of Vytautas the Grand Duchy split in two. Sigismund Kęstutaitis holds Vilnius, Trakai and Samogitia; Polotsk, Vitebsk and Smolensk went over to Švitrigaila, and the Livonian knights ride with him. Now Švitrigaila marches on Vilnius, and Sigismund has sent his son Michael against him, with the Poles of Jakub of Kobylany. Mikołaj Gintovt leads his banner in Michael's army. His brother Jurij rides with Švitrigaila."

msgid "After the death of great Vytautas the Grand Duchy became like one coat for two. Vilnius pulls one way, Polotsk the other, and the seams crack."
msgstr "After the death of great Vytautas the Grand Duchy became like one coat for two. Vilnius pulls one way, Polotsk the other, and the seams crack."

