msgstr "Aggressive"

msgid "All places of power held for five minutes."
msgstr "All places of power held for five minutes."

msgid "All three Smolensk banners fall"
msgstr "All three Smolensk banners fall"

msgid "All three Smolensk banners have fallen. The wings are torn apart."
msgstr "All three Smolensk banners have fallen. The wings are torn apart."

msgid "Always on"
msgstr "Always on"

msgid "An alka, a pagan sanctuary. It gathers Power for spells and trains wise women; near it their spells recharge faster."
msgstr "An alka, a pagan sanctuary. It gathers Power for spells and trains wise women; near it their spells recharge faster."

msgid "An archer at home in the forest."
msgstr "An archer at home in the forest."

msgid "An oak can be cut down. But the place where it grew is still here. Set stones in a circle, as your grandfather did, and the fire will come back."
msgstr "An oak can be cut down. But the place where it grew is still here. Set stones in a circle, as your grandfather did, and the fire will come back."

msgid "And about the grove?"
msgstr "And about the grove?"

msgid "And the next year the churches in Samogitia burned again. Great-grandfather took no part in it. But he gave away none of the people who burned them."
msgstr "And the next year the churches in Samogitia burned again. Great-grandfather took no part in it. But he gave away none of the people who burned them."

msgid "And the straw broke, as Lord Jakub had said. The ones in front did not know what was with the ones behind, and the ones behind thought the ones in front were already being beaten."
msgstr "And the straw broke, as Lord Jakub had said. The ones in front did not know what was with the ones behind, and the ones behind thought the ones in front were already being beaten."

msgid "And who saw it, apart from you?"
msgstr "And who saw it, apart from you?"

msgid "And whose man are you?"
msgstr "And whose man are you?"

msgid "And you?"
msgstr "And you?"

msgid "Andrei Gintovt falls or is left on the far bank"
msgstr "Andrei Gintovt falls or is left on the far bank"

msgid "Andrei Gintovt has fallen. His banner has nobody to carry it home."
msgstr "Andrei Gintovt has fallen. His banner has nobody to carry it home."

msgid "Andrei Gintovt stayed on the far bank and was taken captive along with the hetman."
msgstr "Andrei Gintovt stayed on the far bank and was taken captive along with the hetman."

msgid "Archbishop Jan"
msgstr "Archbishop Jan"

msgid "Archers among the trees are harder to hit. Let the spearmen hold the Order's men while your archers shoot from the forest."
msgstr "Archers among the trees are harder to hit. Let the spearmen hold the Order's men while your archers shoot from the forest."

msgid "Archers: +1 pierce damage and +1 range."
msgstr "Archers: +1 pierce damage and +1 range."

