msgid "By evening there was no Order left on the field. The Master lay among his own, and with him many of the elder brothers. Their banners the king later had hung in Kraków."
msgstr "By evening there was no Order left on the field. The Master lay among his own, and with him many of the elder brothers. Their banners the king later had hung in Kraków."

msgid "By the broken bridge the ring of Muscovite horse closed in. The bodyguards fell one after another. An arrow struck the hetman's horse, and it went down on its side. Ostrogski, wounded, rose to one knee with his sabre. The boyars' sons stood round him, and none struck: such a captive is taken alive."
msgstr "By the broken bridge the ring of Muscovite horse closed in. The bodyguards fell one after another. An arrow struck the hetman's horse, and it went down on its side. Ostrogski, wounded, rose to one knee with his sabre. The boyars' sons stood round him, and none struck: such a captive is taken alive."

