msgid "Now listen. The land gives strength to whoever holds it. The Germans have their own strength, from books and the bones of saints. We have ours: from groves, from water, from the stones where the gods stood. Send me girls who know herbs. I will teach them to call the mist."
msgstr "Now listen. The land gives strength to whoever holds it. The Germans have their own strength, from books and the bones of saints. We have ours: from groves, from water, from the stones where the gods stood. Send me girls who know herbs. I will teach them to call the mist."

msgid "Now they will not come here, but to the king. This is no longer a revolt, Gintaut. This is a great war."
msgstr "Now they will not come here, but to the king. This is no longer a revolt, Gintaut. This is a great war."

