msgstr "On that place the prince ordered a church of the Holy Trinity to be built. And the village by the church people called the Slaughter, Pabaiskas in our tongue. After that day neither Švitrigaila nor the Germans came against Vilnius again. That winter at Brest the Order promised to support him no more."

