msgid "Prince Sigismund, son of Kęstutis, fell on Grand Duke Švitrigaila by night at Ashmyany, as on a thief. Švitrigaila went to Polotsk, and after him went Polotsk, Vitebsk, Smolensk, Kyiv and all Volhynia. Vilnius, Trakai and our Samogitia stayed with Sigismund."
msgstr "Prince Sigismund, son of Kęstutis, fell on Grand Duke Švitrigaila by night at Ashmyany, as on a thief. Švitrigaila went to Polotsk, and after him went Polotsk, Vitebsk, Smolensk, Kyiv and all Volhynia. Vilnius, Trakai and our Samogitia stayed with Sigismund."

