msgstr "So many children. Who taught them to cross themselves?"

msgid "Some write that the Lithuanians fled. Others, that they fled on purpose. Grandfather Mikołaj asked his father about it. He laughed and did not answer."
msgstr "Some write that the Lithuanians fled. Others, that they fled on purpose. Grandfather Mikołaj asked his father about it. He laughed and did not answer."

msgid "Someone has cut marks on this pine. Like wolf tracks, and all of them one way."
msgstr "Someone has cut marks on this pine. Like wolf tracks, and all of them one way."

msgid "Someone is riding there. Four of them. And dogs behind them."
msgstr "Someone is riding there. Four of them. And dogs behind them."

